![CDATA[In a momentous gathering, the INDIA bloc's supporters came together at Ramlila Maidan to address pressing political issues. Leaders from multiple parties spoke passionately about the necessity for change, particularly calling for the ousting of Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar. This event highlighted the importance of unity against perceived electoral injustices, with speakers weaving in historical contexts to bolster their arguments regarding voting rights and electoral fairness.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-bloc-rally-at-ramlila-maidan-saw-creative-expression-take-centre-stage-as-slogans-posters-and-placards-delivered-the-message/articleshow/135444786.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-bloc-rally-at-ramlila-maidan-saw-creative-expression-take-centre-stage-as-slogans-posters-and-placards-delivered-the-message/articleshow/135444786.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-02T09:43:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ambika Pandit</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135444912,imgsize-243600.cms"/></item></channel></rss>